ResetOnColumnErrors
  # order defined
  does not allow STI
  resetting on union errors
    handles ActiveRecord::StatementInvalid on the instance level
    with mismatched columns due to schema cache
      resets column information when encountering an UNION error
      logs when column is reset
    with mismatched columns due to coding error
      limits reset_column_information calls
      does reset_column_information after some time has passed
  resetting on missing column error on save
    with mismatched columns due to schema cache
      resets column information when encountering an UnknownAttributeError
      logs when column is reset
      when reset_column_information_on_statement_invalid FF is disabled
        does not reset column information

Discussion ResolvableDiscussion
  # order defined
  does not allow STI
  #resolvable?
    when potentially resolvable
      when all notes are unresolvable
        returns false
      when some notes are unresolvable and some notes are resolvable
        returns true
      when all notes are resolvable
        returns true
    when not potentially resolvable
      returns false
  #resolved?
    when not resolvable
      returns false
    when resolvable
      when all resolvable notes are resolved
        returns true
      when some resolvable notes are not resolved
        returns false
  #to_be_resolved?
    when not resolvable
      returns false
    when resolvable
      when all resolvable notes are resolved
        returns false
      when some resolvable notes are not resolved
        returns true
  #can_resolve?
    when not resolvable
      returns false
    when resolvable
      when not signed in
        returns false
      when signed in
        when the signed in user is the noteable author
          with access to the project
            returns true
            with confidential discussion
              returns true
          without access to the project
            returns false
            with confidential discussion
              returns false
          when noteable is locked
            returns false
        when the signed in user can push to the project
          returns true
          when the noteable has no author
            returns true
        when the signed in user is a random user
          returns false
          when the noteable has no author
            returns false
  #resolve!
    when not resolvable
      returns nil
      doesn't set resolved_at
      doesn't set resolved_by
      doesn't mark as resolved
    when resolvable
      when all resolvable notes are resolved
        doesn't change resolved_at on the resolved notes
        doesn't change resolved_by on the resolved notes
        doesn't change the resolved state on the resolved notes
        doesn't change resolved_at
        doesn't change resolved_by
        doesn't change resolved state
      when some resolvable notes are resolved
        doesn't change resolved_at on the resolved note
        doesn't change resolved_by on the resolved note
        doesn't change the resolved state on the resolved note
        sets resolved_at on the unresolved note
        sets resolved_by on the unresolved note
        marks the unresolved note as resolved
        sets resolved_at
        sets resolved_by
        marks as resolved
      when no resolvable notes are resolved
        sets resolved_at on the unresolved notes
        sets resolved_by on the unresolved notes
        marks the unresolved notes as resolved
        sets resolved_at
        sets resolved_by
        marks as resolved
        broadcasts note change of the noteable
  #unresolve!
    when not resolvable
      returns nil
    when resolvable
      when all resolvable notes are resolved
        unsets resolved_at on the resolved notes
        unsets resolved_by on the resolved notes
        unmarks the resolved notes as resolved
        unsets resolved_at
        unsets resolved_by
        unmarks as resolved
        broadcasts note change of the noteable
      when some resolvable notes are resolved
        unsets resolved_at on the resolved note
        unsets resolved_by on the resolved note
        unmarks the resolved note as resolved
  #first_note_to_resolve
    returns the first note that still needs to be resolved
  #last_resolved_note
    returns the last note that was resolved
  #clear_memoized_values
    resets the memoized values

Note ResolvableNote
  # order defined
  does not allow STI
  resolvability scopes
    .potentially_resolvable
      includes diff and discussion notes on issues and merge requests
    .resolvable
      includes non-system diff and discussion notes on issues and merge requests
    .resolved
      includes resolved non-system diff and discussion notes on issues and merge requests
    .unresolved
      includes non-resolved non-system diff and discussion notes on issues and merge requests
  .resolvable_types
    is expected to eq ["DiffNote", "DiscussionNote", "Epic"]
  .resolve!
    resolves only the resolvable, not yet resolved notes
  .unresolve!
    unresolves the resolved notes
  #resolvable?
    when potentially resolvable
      when a system note
        returns false
      when a regular note
        returns true
    when not potentially resolvable
      returns false
  #to_be_resolved?
    when not resolvable
      returns false
    when resolvable
      when resolved
        returns false
      when not resolved
        returns true
  #resolved?
    when not resolvable
      returns false
    when resolvable
      when the note has been resolved
        returns true
      when the note has not been resolved
        returns false
  #resolve!
    when not resolvable
      returns false
      doesn't set resolved_at
      doesn't set resolved_by
      doesn't mark as resolved
    when resolvable
      when already resolved
        returns false
        doesn't change resolved_at
        doesn't change resolved_by
        doesn't change resolved status
      when not yet resolved
        returns true
        sets resolved_at
        sets resolved_by
        marks as resolved
        updates the updated_at timestamp
  #unresolve!
    when not resolvable
      returns false
    when resolvable
      when resolved
        returns true
        unsets resolved_at
        unsets resolved_by
        unmarks as resolved
        updates the updated_at timestamp
      when not resolved
        returns false
  #potentially_resolvable?
    returns false if noteable could not be found
  validations
    validates the presence of resolved_by when resolved?
    when importing
      does not validate the presence of resolved_by

Group Routable
  # order defined
  does not allow STI
  creates route with namespace referencing group
  behaves like routable resource
    behaves like .find_by_full_path
      finds records by their full path
      returns nil for unknown paths
      does not have cross-join
      when path is a negative number
        returns nil
      with redirect routes
        without follow_redirects option
          does not find records by their redirected path
        with follow_redirects option set to true
          finds records by their canonical path
          finds records by their redirected path
          returns nil for unknown paths
    behaves like .where_full_path_in
