        reports 1 changed task(s)
    with task table items
      when no tasks have changed
        behaves like get_updated_tasks
          reports 0 changed task(s)
      when a task has changed status
        behaves like get_updated_tasks
          reports 1 changed task(s)
      when a task has changed status causing sourcepos adjustment
        behaves like get_updated_tasks
          reports 1 changed task(s)
